[h1]Hello wizards! [/h1]

The first update of Lone Land brings improvements based on feedbacks.

What you will find in this update:

[list]
[*] Crystal counter in the pause menu (showing how many were taken and how many are available at the moment);
[*] Performance improvements;
[*] Adjust the location of some crystals, in order to make the achievement of 100 crystals more accessible and fair;
[*] A warning when you try to exit the game that progress will be lost (the progress saving system is planned for the next update);
[/list]

More updates are coming, wait for more news.

Have a magical day!
